  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/P1630035.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(34 fotos) Dimarts 20 de juny, &uacute;ltim dia del curs, ha hagut una demostraci&oacute; al centre Verge del Carme de gossos policia de Massamagrell i Onda.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/06/VehicleUnitatCaninaPoliciaLocalOnda1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>L&#39;Ajuntament d&#39;aquest municipi ha comprat un vehicle nou per a la Unitat Canina de la Policia Local.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630014.jpg\" alt=\"p1630014\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630015.jpg\" alt=\"p1630015\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630016.jpg\" alt=\"p1630016\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630017.jpg\" alt=\"p1630017\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630018.jpg\" alt=\"p1630018\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630019.jpg\" alt=\"p1630019\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630020.jpg\" alt=\"p1630020\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gossospoliciacolevergecarmeonda/p1630021.jpg\" alt=\"p1630021\" s